{"metadata":{"description":"把 Agent 从对话框搬到一张图上——连线即执行 / Orchestrate AI agents by drawing lines","id":"gh:1337284069","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"knotline","slug":"MrMaii/knotline","topics":["agent-orchestration","ai-agents","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","react-flow","workflow"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"把 Agent 从对话框搬到一张图上——连线即执行 / Orchestrate AI agents by drawing lines"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"**English** · 简体中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Knotline (**运筹**) is a project operating map for the DeepSeek Harness sidebar."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Requests, agents, execution, review, and delivery live on one canvas — **a line is a command: it run"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"s real agent work.**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## One line runs one real execution"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Drag a Request onto the canvas and connect it to an Agent. Classification derives an Answer for ques"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"tions, Review Feedback then a Plan for complex work, or a live Task Bench for Debug — then a **real,"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" resumable DSH conversation** does the work. There is no fake execution: status only advances throug"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"h structured lifecycle tools."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Everything a chat gives you, on the map"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**Chat-grade visibility.** Running Task Benches embed a live transcript (you / agent / tools); finis"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"hed work carries the **agent's full reply**, delivery summary, and validation evidence — nothing is "},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ork carries the **agent's full reply**, delivery summary, and validation evidence — nothing is lost."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**Governed by design.** Execution flows through a pre-review artifact and an **independent reviewer*"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"* — self-approval is rejected by the backend. Approval pools let a trusted agent execute only approv"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"approval is rejected by the backend. Approval pools let a trusted agent execute only approved plans."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Six root nodes; everything else grows by itself"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- **Agent + Agent** forms a Team that keeps both conversations and holds an internal discussion befo"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"re assignments;
- **Backlog pools** queue work that idle agents pull automatically;
- **Scheduled Tr"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"iggers** run on a Host-owned timer that survives restarts;
- **Skills** dragged onto an Agent or Tea"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"m bind capabilities for every later run."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Reports read like posts"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Click a Work Report, Answer, or Plan to open a **fullscreen detail page**: the producing agent leads"},{"id":"p13s2","text":", the body renders Markdown (tables included), and a status rail shows whether that agent is busy an"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"d what is queued. **Select any passage to raise a floating annotate button**; comments are relayed t"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"o the producing agent, whose status reply types out beneath your comment."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Open the URL printed by DSH and pick **运筹 / Knotline** in the sidebar: choose a workspace on the ful"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"lscreen picker and hit "Enter Knotline" at the bottom right. A three-step guide greets first-time us"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"een picker and hit "Enter Knotline" at the bottom right. A three-step guide greets first-time users."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Verify"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"See the Chinese product requirements document, docs/architecture.md for the runtime path, and docs/d"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"evelopment.md for local development."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Knotline is licensed under the Apache License 2.0. It descends from the Dashi Taskboard codebase; PR"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"OVENANCE.md records what was carried forward, NOTICE carries the required attribution, and bundled t"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"hird-party code is listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. Knotline is an independent community project, n"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"ot affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by DeepSeek or the upstream Dashi Taskboard authors. P"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"roduct names are used only to describe interoperability."}],"truncated":false}
